m%20clock%20up%20to%20168Mhz%2C%20PCLK1%3D42MHz%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20*%20%20set%20WWDGT%20clock%20%3D%20(PCLK1%20(42MHz)%2F4096)%2F4%20%3D%202563.5Hz%20(0.39ms)%20%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20*%20%20set%20counter%20value%20to%20127%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20*%20%20set%20window%20value%20to%2080%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20*%20%20refresh%20window%20is%3A%200.39ms%20*%20(127-80)%20%20%3C%20refresh%20window%20%3C%20%200.39ms%20*%20(127-0x3F)%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20*%2F%5Cn%20%20%20%20wwdgt_config(127%2C%2080%2C%20WWDGT_CFG_PSC_DIV4)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20wwdgt_enable()%3B%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%E7%AA%97%E5%8F%A3%E7%9C%8B%E9%97%A8%E7%8B%97%E5%88%9D%E5%A7%8B%E5%8C%96%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Night%20Owl%22%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22BMeSJ%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u8df71ba6\" id=\"u8df71ba6\"><code data-lake-id=\"ub42884a2\" id=\"ub42884a2\"><span data-lake-id=\"ubd68c079\" id=\"ubd68c079\">wwdgt_config(uint16_t counter, uint16_t window, uint32_t prescaler)</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u0848c129\" id=\"u0848c129\">配置的是窗口时间，计算窗口时间是需要注意几个参数的含义。</span></p><ul list=\"u68edad52\"><li fid=\"u3c62102f\" data-lake-id=\"uf54c8c8e\" id=\"uf54c8c8e\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1eb72c22\" id=\"u1eb72c22\">counter表示计数值，取值为0x00 - 0x7F</span></li><li fid=\"u3c62102f\" data-lake-id=\"ud06c32bb\" id=\"ud06c32bb\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4a1cab03\" id=\"u4a1cab03\">window表示窗口值，取值为0x00 - 0x7F</span></li><li fid=\"u3c62102f\" data-lake-id=\"u0b517d66\" id=\"u0b517d66\"><span data-lake-id=\"u237787f7\" id=\"u237787f7\">窗口区间的初始值最小为0x3F</span></li><li fid=\"u3c62102f\" data-lake-id=\"u2596c06f\" id=\"u2596c06f\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2b0f0d9c\" id=\"u2b0f0d9c\">窗口计数是递减的，因此是 (counter - 初始值) 为最大时间计数，(counter - 窗口区间值)为最小时间计数</span></li><li fid=\"u3c62102f\" data-lake-id=\"u866340a9\" id=\"u866340a9\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3699d056\" id=\"u3699d056\">一个时钟计数，通过 主频/4096可以得到计数值，4096为12位向下计数器组成。</span></li><li fid=\"u3c62102f\" data-lake-id=\"ufc8108d4\" id=\"ufc8108d4\"><span data-lake-id=\"u490ee538\" id=\"u490ee538\">窗口计数器通过分频，得到一个时钟计数，主频/4096/分频系数</span></li></ul><h4 data-lake-id=\"jD8el\" id=\"jD8el\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf085ba46\" id=\"uf085ba46\">喂狗</span></h4><h4 data-lake-id=\"IyEQi\" id=\"IyEQi\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf178c671\" id=\"uf178c671\">完整代码</span></h4><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22main.c%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5Cn%23include%20%5C%22gd32f4xx.h%5C%22%5Cn%23include%20%5C%22systick.h%5C%22%5Cn%23include%20%3Cstdio.h%3E%5Cn%23include%20%5C%22main.h%5C%22%5Cn%23include%20%5C%22Usart0.h%5C%22%5Cn%5Cnvoid%20Usart0_on_recv(uint8_t*%20data%2C%20uint32_t%20len)%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22recv%3A%20%25s%5C%5Cr%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%20data)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5Cn%5Ctif(data%5B0%5D%20%3D%3D%200x04)%7B%5Cn%5Ct%5Ct%2F%2F%20%E6%A8%A1%E6%8B%9F%E5%8D%A1%E6%AD%BB%E6%93%8D%E4%BD%9C%5Cn%5Ct%5Ctwhile(1)%3B%5Cn%5Ct%7D%5Cn%7D%5Cn%5Cnstatic%20void%20wtd_config()%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20rcu_periph_clock_enable(RCU_WWDGT)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2F*%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20*%20%20System%20clock%20up%20to%20168Mhz%2C%20PCLK1%3D42MHz%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20*%20%20set%20WWDGT%20clock%20%3D%20(PCLK1%20(60MHz)%2F4096)%2F4%20%3D%202563.5Hz%20(0.39ms)%20%20%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20*%20%20set%20counter%20value%20to%20127%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20*%20%20set%20window%20value%20to%2080%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20*%20%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%5Cn%5Ct%E7%AA%97%E5%8F%A3%E5%BC%80%E5%A7%8B%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4-%3E%20(counter%20-%20window)%20*%201%E6%AC%A1%E8%AE%A1%E6%95%B0%E8%80%97%E6%97%B6%20%3D%20%20(127%20-%2080)%20*%200.39ms%20%3D%2018.33ms%5Cn%5Ct%E7%AA%97%E5%8F%A3%E7%BB%93%E6%9D%9F%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4-%3E%20(counter%20-%20%5Ct%200x3F)%20*%201%E6%AC%A1%E8%AE%A1%E6%95%B0%E8%80%97%E6%97%B6%20%3D%20(127%20-%2063)%20*%200.39ms%20%3D%2024.96ms%5Cn%5Ct%5Cn%5Ct%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E5%9C%A8%E7%AA%97%E5%8F%A3%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%E5%86%85%E5%96%82%E7%8B%97%2C%20%E5%90%A6%E5%88%99%E4%BC%9A%E8%A7%A6%E5%8F%91%E9%87%8D%E5%90%AF%5Cn%5Ct18.33ms%20%3C%20duration%20%3C%2024.96ms%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20*%2F%5Cn%20%20%20%20wwdgt_config(127%2C%2080%2C%20WWDGT_CFG_PSC_DIV4)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20wwdgt_enable()%3B%5Cn%7D%5Cn%5Cnint%20main(void)%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20systick_config()%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20Usart0_init()%3B%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20wtd_config()%3B%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22start%5C%5Cr%5C%5Cn%5C%22)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20while(1)%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5Ct%2F%2F%2018.33ms%20%3C%20%E5%AE%89%E5%85%A8%E6%9C%9F%20%3C%2024.96ms%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20%20%20%20delay_1ms(18)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20delay_1ms(22)%3B%20%2F%2F%20%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20%20%20%20delay_1ms(26)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%2F*%20update%20WWDGT%20counter%20*%2F%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20wwdgt_counter_update(127)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7D%5Cn%7D%5Cn%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Atrue%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22main.c%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Night%20Owl%22%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22T4Eys%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h3 data-lake-id=\"x1j4J\" id=\"x1j4J\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue26ca36c\" id=\"ue26ca36c\">注意</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"uf3ccf9bc\" id=\"uf3ccf9bc\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0602bd3b\" id=\"u0602bd3b\">如果计算得到的窗口期和真实的运行结果不一致，要考虑</span><code data-lake-id=\"u423a9c85\" id=\"u423a9c85\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6fea4f38\" id=\"u6fea4f38\">system_gd32f4xx.c</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u16094838\" id=\"u16094838\">里配置的系统时钟是否是168M，即打开该文件，找到__SYSTEM_CLOCK_168M_PLL_8M_HXTAL，释放其注释，保持打开状态。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u1b2ddef9\" id=\"u1b2ddef9\"><span data-lake-id=\"ucd92f741\" id=\"ucd92f741\">参考文档：</span><card type=\"inline\" name=\"yuqueinline\" value=\"data:%7B%22mode%22%3A%22title%22%2C%22heightMode%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.yuque.com%2Ficheima%2Farm32%2Fdlkgvhqbne4kg8aw%23dbdC8%22%2C%22url%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.yuque.com%2Ficheima%2Farm32%2Fdlkgvhqbne4kg8aw%3Fview%3Ddoc_embed%26inner%3DdbdC8%22%2C%22detail%22%3A%7B%22image%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2023%2Fpng%2F27903758%2F1681805361015-b866e35c-87e9-45f2-8f30-7a18ba2f896d.png%22%2C%22title%22%3A%22GD32F4%E6%A0%87%E5%87%86%E5%A4%96%E8%AE%BE%E5%BA%93%F0%9F%8C%9F%F0%9F%8C%9F%F0%9F%8C%9F%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22doc%22%2C%22belong%22%3A%22ARM32%E5%BC%80%E5%8F%91%22%2C%22belong_url%22%3A%22%2Ficheima%2Farm32%22%2C%22desc%22%3A%22%E5%AD%A6%E4%B9%A0%E7%9B%AE%E6%A0%87%E4%BA%86%E8%A7%A3%E6%A0%87%E5%87%86%E5%BA%93%E6%9D%A5%E6%BA%90%E7%86%9F%E6%82%89%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF%E6%90%AD%E5%BB%BA%E6%B5%81%E7%A8%8B%E6%8E%8C%E6%8F%A1%E5%9C%A8%E5%B7%B2%E6%9C%89%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E4%B8%8B%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%E5%BC%80%E5%8F%91%E5%AD%A6%E4%B9%A0%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%E5%BC%80%E5%8F%91%E6%96%87%E6%A1%A3%E8%8E%B7%E5%8F%96%E7%94%A8%E6%88%B7%E6%89%8B%E5%86%8Chttps%3A%2F%2Fgd32mcu.com%2Fcn%2Fdownload%2F6%3Fkw%3DGD32F4xx%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E6%89%8B%E5%86%8Chttps%3A%2F%2Fgd32mcu.com%2Fcn%2Fdownload%3Fkw%3DGD32F407%26lan%3Dcn%E6%A0%87...%22%2C%22url%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.yuque.com%2Ficheima%2Farm32%2Fdlkgvhqbne4kg8aw%23dbdC8%22%2C%22target_type%22%3A%22Doc%22%2C%22extra%22%3A%7B%7D%2C%22_serializer%22%3A%22web.editor_link_detail%22%7D%2C%22id%22%3A%22xiFkj%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"c1YJb\" id=\"c1YJb\"><span data-lake-id=\"u506b644e\" id=\"u506b644e\">练习题</span></h2><ol list=\"u00b8e9c6\"><li fid=\"u2